WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.010
Cat whispered to Tom.

2
00:00:09.011 --> 00:00:11.934
"Tell the unicorn you are a great wizard.

3
00:00:11.935 --> 00:00:17.297
Tell her that you can make monsters appear."

4
00:00:17.298 --> 00:00:20.248
Cat slipped into the trees.

5
00:00:20.249 --> 00:00:23.716
"I am a great wizard!" Tom cried.

6
00:00:23.717 --> 00:00:27.023
"I will get a monster to fight you, Unicorn!"

7
00:00:27.024 --> 00:00:30.022
The unicorn laughed.

8
00:00:30.023 --> 00:00:33.394
"You? A great wizard?"

9
00:00:33.395 --> 00:00:39.645
"Alakazam!" Tom pretended to say a spell. "Abracadabra!"

10
00:00:39.646 --> 00:00:46.609
The unicorn laughed and laughed.

11
00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:51.833
Then a fierce growl came from the trees.

12
00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:56.320
The unicorn looked around.

13
00:00:56.321 --> 00:00:59.382
"What's that?" she asked nervously.

14
00:00:59.383 --> 00:01:02.573
Cat was hiding behind the trees.

15
00:01:02.574 --> 00:01:07.571
She moaned and howled.

16
00:01:07.572 --> 00:01:11.611
"That is my monster!" Tom said loudly.

17
00:01:11.612 --> 00:01:15.629
"Your monster?" the unicorn said.

18
00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.305
"See?" Princess Mary said to the unicorn.

19
00:01:19.306 --> 00:01:25.547
"Tom is a great wizard!"

20
00:01:25.548 --> 00:01:32.870
Cat ran to find the ogre.

21
00:01:32.871 --> 00:01:39.332
He was sleeping near a cave.

22
00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:44.803
Cat snarled in his ear.

23
00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:51.073
The ogre woke up.

24
00:01:51.074 --> 00:01:57.793
Cat ran back to the unicorn's woods.

25
00:01:57.794 --> 00:02:03.271
Cat growled and howled like a monster.

26
00:02:03.272 --> 00:02:05.673
The unicorn looked scared.

27
00:02:05.674 --> 00:02:10.629
"Princess Mary can return to the castle!" the unicorn said.

28
00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:15.950
"Just tell your monster to go away!"

29
00:02:15.951 --> 00:02:19.138
Tom and Princess Mary ran out of the clearing.

30
00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:23.135
Cat dashed after them.

31
00:02:23.136 --> 00:02:26.944
"Hey!" The unicorn spotted Cat.

32
00:02:26.945 --> 00:02:29.805
"That's not a monster!"

33
00:02:29.806 --> 00:02:32.145
The unicorn stamped her hoof.

34
00:02:32.146 --> 00:02:38.928
"Wizard, you tricked me!"

